   "source": [
    "## 5. Quantitative Physicochemical Shift Analysis\n",
    "We evaluate amino acid perturbations using three metrics:\n",
    "1. **Kyte-Doolittle Hydropathy Index:** Measures residue hydrophobicity ($>0$ = hydrophobic, $<0$ = hydrophilic).\n",
    "2. **Formal Sidechain Charge:** Formal net charge near physiological pH ($7.4$).\n",
    "3. **Grantham Distance ($D_g$):** Standard chemical dissimilarity score based on composition, polarity, and volume."
   ]
  },
