    "## 6. Wild-Type 3D Structural Context (`1A3N.pdb`)\n",
    "We extract the mature $\\beta$-globin subunit (**Chain B**) from Deoxyhemoglobin (`1A3N.pdb`)[cite: 8] and compute Euclidean distances between the C$\\alpha$ of native Glu6 and all other intra-chain C$\\alpha$ atoms within an **$8.0\\text{ \\AA}$ contact radius**:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$d = \\sqrt{(x_2 - x_1)^2 + (y_2 - y_1)^2 + (z_2 - z_1)^2}$$"
   ]
  },
