    "## 9. Limitations & Reproducibility\n",
    "\n",
    "### Methodological Limitations\n",
    "* The analysis relies on static wild-type coordinates (`1A3N`)[cite: 8]; it does not model backbone relaxation or side-chain rotamers in mutant states.\n",
    "* C$\\alpha$ spatial distance is a geometric proximity metric and does not represent atomic contact surfaces, hydrogen bonds, or salt bridges.\n",
    "* Charges are reported as simplified formal side-chain states near physiological pH without computing solvent-accessible local pKa shifts.\n",
